Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData[
 "TableauColumns"], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "662e395d-fe41-40eb-b045-e40bbe54120d"],
 " is the one that earns its keep on ragged shapes: it returns the slot \
indices column by column, correctly stopping each column when the diagram \
does. Compare row reading and column reading for the L-shape ",
